/* TrackZero drape colours, Light (Phase 36, Tokens v2 "Map style · Light"): copy of default/light/drape_colors.mapcss
   with the signal rule applied (rider arrow, accuracy halo, selection, default track in the dark signal green
   #005F35), the ruler text in text2 and the Track* colours of the GPX route line: a dark green core with a white
   casing and white chevrons (a mint line is invisible on a light map). TrackLineOff is the green at about 45 % on the
   light ground; TrackGlow (debug candidate A only) is the green at 18 % pre-composited on #F4F4EF.
   kothic reads only the first colors{} block, so this file replaces the default one instead of overriding it. */

colors
{
  GuiText-color: #4E5359;
  GuiText-opacity: 1.0;
  MyPositionAccuracy-color: #005F35;
  MyPositionAccuracy-opacity: 0.08;
  Selection-color: #005F35;
  Selection-opacity: 0.64;
